<mjml>
  <mj-body background-color="#f7eeea" width="600px">

    <mj-section background-color="#d4471a" padding-top="30px" padding-right="0px" padding-bottom="4px" padding-left="0px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-image src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0780/2290/1980/files/rep-cb-logo.png" alt="Repeat" width="130px" height="36px" align="center" href="https://repeatonline.com.br" padding-top="0px" padding-right="0px" padding-bottom="0px" padding-left="0px"></mj-image>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-section background-color="#d4471a" padding-top="0px" padding-right="0px" padding-bottom="0px" padding-left="0px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-image src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0780/2290/1980/files/rep-cb-hero-v2.jpg" alt="Seu cashback chegou! 5% de volta em cada compra" width="600px" href="https://repeatonline.com.br/discount/{{cupom}}?redirect=%2Fcollections%2Fall" padding-top="0px" padding-right="0px" padding-bottom="0px" padding-left="0px"></mj-image>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-section css-class="fc-if--primeiro_nome" background-color="#f2e2dc" padding-top="14px" padding-right="48px" padding-bottom="0px" padding-left="48px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text align="center" font-family="'Avenir Next', Avenir, 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="24px" font-weight="700" line-height="30px" color="#d4471a" padding-top="0px" padding-right="0px" padding-bottom="12px" padding-left="0px">Oi, {{primeiro_nome}}!</mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-section css-class="fc-ifnot--primeiro_nome" background-color="#f2e2dc" padding-top="14px" padding-right="48px" padding-bottom="0px" padding-left="48px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text align="center" font-family="'Avenir Next', Avenir, 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="24px" font-weight="700" line-height="30px" color="#d4471a" padding-top="0px" padding-right="0px" padding-bottom="12px" padding-left="0px">Oi!</mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-section background-color="#f2e2dc" padding-top="0px" padding-right="48px" padding-bottom="22px" padding-left="48px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text align="center" font-family="'Avenir Next', Avenir, 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="17px" line-height="27px" color="#571713" padding-top="0px" padding-right="0px" padding-bottom="0px" padding-left="0px">Sua compra rendeu <strong>R$ {{valor_cashback}} de cashback</strong> pra usar no próximo pedido. Aqui na Repeat, 5% de cada compra volta pra você, porque repetir o que te faz bem tem que valer a pena.</mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-section background-color="#f2e2dc" padding-top="0px" padding-right="48px" padding-bottom="0px" padding-left="48px">
      <mj-column background-color="#ffffff" border="2px dashed #d4471a" border-radius="18px" padding-top="22px" padding-right="12px" padding-bottom="22px" padding-left="12px">
        <mj-text align="center" font-family="'Avenir Next', Avenir, 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="12px" font-weight="700" line-height="16px" letter-spacing="2.5px" color="#a64208" padding-top="0px" padding-right="0px" padding-bottom="8px" padding-left="0px">SEU CUPOM DE CASHBACK</mj-text>
        <mj-text align="center" font-family="'HWT Artz', 'Helvetica Neue Condensed', 'HelveticaNeue-CondensedBold', 'Roboto Condensed', 'Arial Narrow', 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif" font-size="38px" font-weight="700" line-height="44px" letter-spacing="2px" color="#d4471a" padding-top="0px" padding-right="0px" padding-bottom="8px" padding-left="0px"><span style="word-break:break-all;">{{cupom}}</span></mj-text>
        <mj-text align="center" font-family="'Avenir Next', Avenir, 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="14px" line-height="20px" color="#571713" padding-top="0px" padding-right="0px" padding-bottom="0px" padding-left="0px"><span style="white-space:nowrap;"><strong>R$ {{valor_cashback}}</strong> de cashback</span> · <span style="white-space:nowrap;">válido até {{data_vencimento}}</span></mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-section background-color="#f2e2dc" padding-top="24px" padding-right="48px" padding-bottom="38px" padding-left="48px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-button href="https://repeatonline.com.br/discount/{{cupom}}?redirect=%2Fcollections%2Fall" background-color="#d4471a" color="#ffffff" font-family="'Avenir Next', Avenir, 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="16px" font-weight="700" letter-spacing="1px" border-radius="40px" inner-padding="18px 24px" width="100%" padding-top="0px" padding-right="0px" padding-bottom="14px" padding-left="0px">QUERO USAR MEU CASHBACK</mj-button>
        <mj-text align="center" font-family="'Avenir Next', Avenir, 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="13px" line-height="19px" color="#8a4b3f" padding-top="0px" padding-right="0px" padding-bottom="0px" padding-left="0px">O botão já aplica o cashback no carrinho. Se preferir, digite <strong>{{cupom}}</strong> no checkout.</mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-section background-color="#ffffff" padding-top="36px" padding-right="48px" padding-bottom="10px" padding-left="48px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text align="center" font-family="'HWT Artz', 'Helvetica Neue Condensed', 'HelveticaNeue-CondensedBold', 'Roboto Condensed', 'Arial Narrow', 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif" font-size="32px" font-weight="700" line-height="36px" color="#d4471a" padding-top="0px" padding-right="0px" padding-bottom="0px" padding-left="0px">COMO USAR</mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-section css-class="fc-nostack" background-color="#ffffff" padding-top="12px" padding-right="56px" padding-bottom="0px" padding-left="56px">
      <mj-column width="20%" vertical-align="top">
        <mj-text font-family="'HWT Artz', 'Helvetica Neue Condensed', 'HelveticaNeue-CondensedBold', 'Roboto Condensed', 'Arial Narrow', 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif" font-size="38px" font-weight="700" line-height="40px" color="#d4471a" padding-top="0px" padding-right="0px" padding-bottom="0px" padding-left="0px">01.</mj-text>
      </mj-column>
      <mj-column width="80%" vertical-align="top">
        <mj-text font-family="'Avenir Next', Avenir, 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="15px" line-height="22px" color="#571713" padding-top="2px" padding-right="0px" padding-bottom="0px" padding-left="0px"><strong style="font-size:17px;">Escolha seus favoritos</strong><br>Edamame, alga, cracker de coco, crispy: monte o pedido do seu jeito.</mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-section css-class="fc-nostack" background-color="#ffffff" padding-top="20px" padding-right="56px" padding-bottom="0px" padding-left="56px">
      <mj-column width="20%" vertical-align="top">
        <mj-text font-family="'HWT Artz', 'Helvetica Neue Condensed', 'HelveticaNeue-CondensedBold', 'Roboto Condensed', 'Arial Narrow', 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif" font-size="38px" font-weight="700" line-height="40px" color="#d4471a" padding-top="0px" padding-right="0px" padding-bottom="0px" padding-left="0px">02.</mj-text>
      </mj-column>
      <mj-column width="80%" vertical-align="top">
        <mj-text font-family="'Avenir Next', Avenir, 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="15px" line-height="22px" color="#571713" padding-top="2px" padding-right="0px" padding-bottom="0px" padding-left="0px"><strong style="font-size:17px;">Aplique o cupom</strong><br>Pelo botão deste e-mail o seu cupom entra sozinho. Ou digite no checkout.</mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-section css-class="fc-nostack" background-color="#ffffff" padding-top="20px" padding-right="56px" padding-bottom="40px" padding-left="56px">
      <mj-column width="20%" vertical-align="top">
        <mj-text font-family="'HWT Artz', 'Helvetica Neue Condensed', 'HelveticaNeue-CondensedBold', 'Roboto Condensed', 'Arial Narrow', 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif" font-size="38px" font-weight="700" line-height="40px" color="#d4471a" padding-top="0px" padding-right="0px" padding-bottom="0px" padding-left="0px">03.</mj-text>
      </mj-column>
      <mj-column width="80%" vertical-align="top">
        <mj-text font-family="'Avenir Next', Avenir, 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="15px" line-height="22px" color="#571713" padding-top="2px" padding-right="0px" padding-bottom="0px" padding-left="0px"><strong style="font-size:17px;">Repita o que te faz bem</strong><br>A cada compra, mais 5% volta pra você em cashback.</mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-section background-color="#f2e2dc" padding-top="36px" padding-right="48px" padding-bottom="16px" padding-left="48px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text align="center" font-family="'HWT Artz', 'Helvetica Neue Condensed', 'HelveticaNeue-CondensedBold', 'Roboto Condensed', 'Arial Narrow', 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif" font-size="32px" font-weight="700" line-height="36px" color="#d4471a" padding-top="0px" padding-right="0px" padding-bottom="6px" padding-left="0px">PRA REPETIR (OU PROVAR)</mj-text>
        <mj-text align="center" font-family="'Avenir Next', Avenir, 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="15px" line-height="22px" color="#571713" padding-top="0px" padding-right="0px" padding-bottom="0px" padding-left="0px">Os queridinhos de quem já conhece a Repeat.</mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-section background-color="#f2e2dc" padding-top="0px" padding-right="26px" padding-bottom="40px" padding-left="26px">
      <mj-column padding-top="6px" padding-right="6px" padding-bottom="6px" padding-left="6px" inner-background-color="#ffffff" inner-border-radius="16px">
        <mj-image src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0780/2290/1980/files/rep-cb-edamame.jpg" alt="Snack de Edamame Crocante" width="160px" href="https://repeatonline.com.br/products/snack-de-edamame-sal-marinho-repeat-28g" padding-top="12px" padding-right="0px" padding-bottom="4px" padding-left="0px"></mj-image>
        <mj-text align="center" font-family="'Avenir Next', Avenir, 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="15px" font-weight="700" line-height="20px" color="#571713" padding-top="0px" padding-right="10px" padding-bottom="2px" padding-left="10px">Edamame Crocante</mj-text>
        <mj-text align="center" font-family="'Avenir Next', Avenir, 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="13px" line-height="18px" color="#8a4b3f" padding-top="0px" padding-right="10px" padding-bottom="12px" padding-left="10px">13g de proteína</mj-text>
        <mj-button href="https://repeatonline.com.br/products/snack-de-edamame-sal-marinho-repeat-28g" background-color="#d4471a" color="#ffffff" font-family="'Avenir Next', Avenir, 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="13px" font-weight="700" letter-spacing="1px" border-radius="40px" inner-padding="10px 24px" padding-top="0px" padding-right="0px" padding-bottom="18px" padding-left="0px">COMPRAR</mj-button>
      </mj-column>
      <mj-column padding-top="6px" padding-right="6px" padding-bottom="6px" padding-left="6px" inner-background-color="#ffffff" inner-border-radius="16px">
        <mj-image src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0780/2290/1980/files/rep-cb-alga.jpg" alt="Snack de Alga Marinha" width="160px" href="https://repeatonline.com.br/products/snack-alga-tradicional-repeat" padding-top="12px" padding-right="0px" padding-bottom="4px" padding-left="0px"></mj-image>
        <mj-text align="center" font-family="'Avenir Next', Avenir, 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="15px" font-weight="700" line-height="20px" color="#571713" padding-top="0px" padding-right="10px" padding-bottom="2px" padding-left="10px">Alga Marinha</mj-text>
        <mj-text align="center" font-family="'Avenir Next', Avenir, 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="13px" line-height="18px" color="#8a4b3f" padding-top="0px" padding-right="10px" padding-bottom="12px" padding-left="10px">Crocante e low carb</mj-text>
        <mj-button href="https://repeatonline.com.br/products/snack-alga-tradicional-repeat" background-color="#d4471a" color="#ffffff" font-family="'Avenir Next', Avenir, 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="13px" font-weight="700" letter-spacing="1px" border-radius="40px" inner-padding="10px 24px" padding-top="0px" padding-right="0px" padding-bottom="18px" padding-left="0px">COMPRAR</mj-button>
      </mj-column>
      <mj-column padding-top="6px" padding-right="6px" padding-bottom="6px" padding-left="6px" inner-background-color="#ffffff" inner-border-radius="16px">
        <mj-image src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0780/2290/1980/files/rep-cb-coco.jpg" alt="Cracker de Coco" width="160px" href="https://repeatonline.com.br/products/cracker-de-coco-original-repeat-50g" padding-top="12px" padding-right="0px" padding-bottom="4px" padding-left="0px"></mj-image>
        <mj-text align="center" font-family="'Avenir Next', Avenir, 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="15px" font-weight="700" line-height="20px" color="#571713" padding-top="0px" padding-right="10px" padding-bottom="2px" padding-left="10px">Cracker de Coco</mj-text>
        <mj-text align="center" font-family="'Avenir Next', Avenir, 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="13px" line-height="18px" color="#8a4b3f" padding-top="0px" padding-right="10px" padding-bottom="12px" padding-left="10px">Coco de verdade</mj-text>
        <mj-button href="https://repeatonline.com.br/products/cracker-de-coco-original-repeat-50g" background-color="#d4471a" color="#ffffff" font-family="'Avenir Next', Avenir, 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="13px" font-weight="700" letter-spacing="1px" border-radius="40px" inner-padding="10px 24px" padding-top="0px" padding-right="0px" padding-bottom="18px" padding-left="0px">COMPRAR</mj-button>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-section background-color="#d4471a" padding-top="0px" padding-right="0px" padding-bottom="0px" padding-left="0px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-image src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0780/2290/1980/files/rep-cb-manifesto.jpg" alt="Prazer que cabe na sua rotina." width="600px" href="https://repeatonline.com.br/collections/all" padding-top="0px" padding-right="0px" padding-bottom="0px" padding-left="0px"></mj-image>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-section background-color="#571713" padding-top="34px" padding-right="40px" padding-bottom="36px" padding-left="40px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-image src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0780/2290/1980/files/rep-cb-logo.png" alt="Repeat" width="100px" height="28px" align="center" href="https://repeatonline.com.br" padding-top="0px" padding-right="0px" padding-bottom="20px" padding-left="0px"></mj-image>
        <mj-text align="center" font-family="'Avenir Next', Avenir, 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="13px" font-weight="700" line-height="20px" color="#f2e2dc" padding-top="0px" padding-right="0px" padding-bottom="18px" padding-left="0px"><a href="https://www.instagram.com/repeatfoods/" style="color:#f2e2dc;text-decoration:none;white-space:nowrap;">Instagram @repeatfoods</a> &nbsp;·&nbsp; <a href="https://wa.me/5511947947874" style="color:#f2e2dc;text-decoration:none;white-space:nowrap;">WhatsApp (11) 94794-7874</a></mj-text>
        <mj-text align="center" font-family="'Avenir Next', Avenir, 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="11px" line-height="17px" color="#d9b9ae" padding-top="0px" padding-right="0px" padding-bottom="10px" padding-left="0px">Kalena Importação Exportação e Comércio Ltda · CNPJ 10.293.200/0001-33<br>Av. Angélica, 2503, cj. 101 · São Paulo/SP · 01227-200</mj-text>
        <mj-text align="center" font-family="'Avenir Next', Avenir, 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="11px" line-height="17px" color="#d9b9ae" padding-top="0px" padding-right="0px" padding-bottom="0px" padding-left="0px">Você recebeu este e-mail porque comprou na Repeat.<br><a href="{{link_optout}}" style="color:#d9b9ae;text-decoration:underline;">Não quero mais receber</a></mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

  </mj-body>
</mjml>
